                    <chunk name="param_input" index="6">
                      <items count="6">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Solve the mean age of air (OpenFOAM 'age' function object) during the run. Age [s] is the time since the air at each point entered the domain — the urban ventilation/stagnation map (low = well flushed, high = trapped in canyons/courtyards). Adds a cheap scalar transport solved alongside the flow at every iteration (turbulent diffusion on) and written with the other fields; the 'age' field is then viewable in ParaView or probe-able. Optional; default is false.</item>
