                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">PIMPLE only: Courant number cap that sets the time step. 0 defaults to 1: PIMPLE's outer correctors keep Co &gt; 1 stable, not time-accurate, and a wake's shedding needs Co below 1 (Wolf Dynamics, GT-100). Raising it buys wall-clock at the cost of time accuracy; lower it if the run goes unstable. Optional.</item>
