                  <items count="4">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Define a pollutant emission source for the wind study: a closed volume (stack tip, traffic corridor box, exhaust vent) releasing a named species at a mass rate. Wire into the Eddy3D Case component's Sources input; the species is transported as a passive scalar with turbulent diffusivity (Sct) on every direction case, and the concentration field (kg/m3) is read back by probing the species name.

