                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Purpose: Where a street-level emission goes, and how much reaches pedestrians.
Fidelity: Engineering - steady RANS with a passive tracer, not validated for this canyon.
Method: Two 40 x 20 x 20 m blocks form a canyon; Pollutant Source releases 0.01 kg/s of exhaust from a volume inside it.
Result: Tracer concentration in kg/m3 at three points 2 m above ground along the canyon centreline.
Needs: Eddy3D Setup &gt; (U)RANS CFD (OpenFOAM). Runtime: minutes.
Edit: Blocks, source volume and rate, probe points; turn the toggles on.</item>
                  </items>
